    "content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Hi Alex,</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">The analytics platform contract renews on <b>November 1</b> and procurement needs a decision by October 22. Here's the renewal quote next to what we pay today:<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Line item</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Current</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Renewal quote</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Platform licence (25 seats)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">$18,000</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">$21,600</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Data retention add-on</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">$2,400</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">$2,400</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Support tier</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Standard</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Premium (bundled)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">The 20% licence increase is well above our 8% guideline. Could you ask the vendor whether they'd hold current pricing for a two-year term?</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Thanks,<br>Finley</div></body></html>"
  }
